30:11.580 --> 30:14.680
It's a mathematical structure they denote as J tensor J.

30:15.060 --> 30:17.780
That's a J, a circle with a cross in it, and another J.

30:18.080 --> 30:19.640
Let's break down J tensor J.

30:19.820 --> 30:20.900
