34:44.640 --> 34:50.400
For any value of co other than zero, that state cannot be factored into independent local

34:50.400 --> 34:51.260
product states.

34:51.560 --> 34:54.580
It is mathematically, provably entangled.

34:54.960 --> 34:55.160
Okay.

34:55.200 --> 34:58.160
