Einstein crazy, the thing we considered the defining feature of the quantum realm, isn't

35:23.120 --> 35:25.660
actually a property of the physical system itself.

35:25.780 --> 35:26.040
Right.

35:26.040 --> 35:29.140
It's a property of the math we are using to look at the system.

35:29.340 --> 35:32.580
You are grasping the exact magnitude of what this text proves.

35:33.060 --> 35:37.100
Entanglement is not an intrinsic, unchangeable property of a physical matrix.

35:37.300 --> 35:38.200
It is just, wow.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.380
It is field relative.

35:39.720 --> 35:43.440
It is entirely relative to the scalar field, real or complex, doing the composing.

35:43.720 --> 35:48.680
Because if you switch to complex numbers, that invisible J tensor J witness is no longer

35:48.680 --> 35:51.740
built out of locally impossible antisymmetric matrices.

35:52.060 --> 35:52.260
Right.

35:52.320 --> 35:54.320
Because complex numbers handle that inherently.

35:54.520 --> 35:55.020
Exactly.

35:55.020 --> 36:01.460
In complex numbers, it is just negative one times the normal product of complex polymatrices.

36:01.820 --> 36:05.100
It's totally observable using complex local bases.

36:05.560 --> 36:12.460
What requires spooky entanglement in real numbers is just a mundane classical correlation in complex

36:12.460 --> 36:12.880
numbers.

36:13.080 --> 36:14.140
That is mind-blowing.

36:14.140 --> 36:15.520
I need to put this into an analogy.

36:16.200 --> 36:19.480
Imagine two people sitting in a room sharing a secret language.

36:19.640 --> 36:19.840
Right.

36:20.040 --> 36:24.700
Let's say they are perfectly fluent in Navajo and they are discussing a complex engineering

36:24.700 --> 36:25.160
project.

36:25.260 --> 36:25.480
Okay.

36:25.560 --> 36:26.000
I'm tracking.

36:26.200 --> 36:29.080
Now, imagine an English-only speaker is watching them.

36:29.480 --> 36:32.220
The English speaker represents real numbers.

36:32.680 --> 36:36.500
To the English speaker, these two people seem telepathically linked.

36:36.580 --> 36:36.760
Right.

